cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Nanda Town 2 or its evidence data, please cite it."
title: "Nanda Town 2: A public registry of AI agents and services with scheduled probe evidence"
abstract: >-
  Nanda Town 2 is an open registry in which each listing is a version-controlled
  record and each declared endpoint is probed on a schedule. Every probe is
  stored as an evidence record naming one observer, one subject, and one time.
  The registry publishes observation histories rather than scores or
  verification labels, and exports all evidence for independent recomputation.
authors:
  - name: "Project NANDA"
    website: "https://github.com/projnanda"
repository-code: "https://github.com/projnanda/nanda-town-2"
url: "https://nanda-town-2.up.railway.app"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - service registry
  - Model Context Protocol
  - agent interoperability
  - liveness monitoring
